// Pig Latin - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# Pig Latin is a transformation language, so its program is a word
# transformed. A word beginning with a vowel gains "way"; a word
# beginning with a consonant gains "ay" and moves the initial
# consonant to the end.
#
#   Hello World!  ->  elloHay orldWay!
elloHay orldWay!
